            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.14.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 14:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Beitu okwataniise na Yoabu omuri ebyo byona? Omukazi yaamugarukamu ati: Ninkurahira, mukama wangye omugabe, tihariho waakubaasa kutoora aha rubaju rwa buryo nari orwa bumosho, okwetantara ekigambo kyona eki mukama wangye omugabe yaagamba. N'ekya buzima omwiru waawe Yoabu niwe aragiire omuzaana waawe, kandi niwe ampaire ebigambo ebyo byona kubigamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'okwenda ku bihinduka okundi, omwiru waawe Yoabu nikyo abitwariize atyo. Kandi mukama wangye n'omunyabwengye nka maraika wa Ruhanga, naamanya ebiri omu nsi byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe yaagira Yoabu ati: Reeba mbwenu naikiriza; irooko, ogarure ogwo mutsigazi Abusalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu yaagwa ahansi, yaajuumara omu maisho g'omugabe, yaamusiima; naagira ati: Eri izooba omwiru waawe yaamanya ku yaagirirwa embabazi omu maisho gaawe, Nyakusinga omugabe, ahabw'okuba omugabe yaakorera omwiru we eki amushabire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.13.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 13:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Yoabu yaimuka, yaaza Geshuri, yaareeta Abusalomu Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omugabe yaagira ati: Naagarukye omu ka ye, kwonka atarindeeba. Atyo Abusalomu yaaguma wenka omu ka ye, tiyaagira bu areebire omugabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi omu Baisraeli boona tihariho waabaire naasiimwa nka Abusalomu ahabw'oburungi bwe; okuruga aha mara g'ekigyere okuhika aha kazingiro k'eishokye akaba ataine kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha muheru gwa buri mwaka akaba amweisa eishokye rye; ahabw'okumuremeera, nikyo yaabaire arimweisiza, kandi ku yaabaire arimweisa, oburemeezi bwaryo bukaba buba ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "shekeli ezo magana abiri nizingana eraatiri ishatu n'ekicweka.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shekeli magana abiri, nka shekeli y'omugabe oku yaabaire eingana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.18.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 18:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Abusalomu akazaarirwa abaana b'aboojo bashatu, n'omwishiki owaabaire naayetwa Tamari; akaba ari omwishiki murungi omu kureeba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Abusalomu yaamara emyaka ebiri Yerusaalemu, atarikureebana na mugabe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Abusalomu yaatuma kweta Yoabu, ngu amutume aha mugabe; kwonka Yoabu yaayanga kwija. Yaagaruka yaamutumaho obwa kabiri; nabwo yaayanga kwija. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikwo kugambira abairu be ati: Reeba, omusiri gwa Yoabu guhereraine n'ogwangye; hati gurimu sayiri; mugyende mugwotsye. Batyo abairu ba Abusalomu baagyenda, baagwotsya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabu yaimuka, yaaza owa Abusalomu, yaamubuuza ati: Ahabw'enki abairu baawe baanyokyeize omusiri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 20:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.13.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 13:38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abusalomu yaagarukamu Yoabu ati: Reeba nkutumireho ngu oije aha, nkutume aha mugabe, omumbuurize oti: Nkaihwa ki Geshuri? Haakiri kuri naagumireyo n'okuhitsya hati. Mbwenu omugabe anyikirize ndeebane nawe; ku harabe hariho okutahikiirira omuriinye, anyite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 14:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.29.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 29:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.31.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31:55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.15.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 15:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo Yoabu yaaza ow'omugabe, yaabimugambira. Bwanyima omugabe yaatuma ahari Abusalomu, yaija; ku yaahikire omugabe, yainama ahansi omu maisho ge; omugabe yaamunywegyera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.14.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.14.33"
            ]
          }
        }
